(* fs-records-s2b C5b, witness written as a correspondence (expected FALSE):
   failure neutrality.  "A rejected attempt at sequence t never precedes an
   acceptance of t" is false: a forged frame at t is rejected and the
   genuine frame at t is accepted afterwards.  Also the target of the
   control C-FAILMUT, under which it must become TRUE. *)
query s: bitstring, b: bitstring, kid: key_id, root: bitstring, t: nat, m: bitstring,
      i: time, j: time;
  event(FsReceiveRejected(server_to_beacon(), s, b, kid, root, t))@i
  && event(FsReceived(server_to_beacon(), s, b, kid, root, t, m))@j
  ==> j < i.

process FsRecordsS2bMain()
